{"code":"001527","name":"동양2우B","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"건축자재","sector_desc":"시멘트·창호·인테리어 자재 등. 주택 착공과 건설 경기를 후행해서 따라갑니다.","desc":"동사는 1955년 동양세멘트공업(주)로 설립되어 1976년 기업공개를 실시하였으며, 현재 11개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 레미콘 건재사업, 아파트 건설사업, 아크릴원사 및 부직포 섬유사업, 산업용 송풍기 플랜트 사업부문을 영위하고 있음. 건자재 네트워크, 건설서비스, 인프라엔지니어링 기반 솔루션 Provider를 지향하며, 전국 17개 레미콘 공장과 부산권역 3개 골재 사업장을 운영하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":3485.0,"open":3205.0,"high":3495.0,"low":3090.0,"volume":401,"amount":1397485.0,"ret_1d":12.7832,"gap":3.7217,"range_pct":11.6212,"ret_5":-19.7005,"ret_20":-35.3432,"ret_60":-50.1431,"ret_120":-76.7356,"ret_250":-80.5089,"ma20":4543.25,"ma60":5715.75,"ma120":9097.0417,"ma200":12121.125,"close_vs_ma200":-71.2485,"close_vs_ma60":-39.0281,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-92.677,"r2_60":0.812,"slope_120":-95.7036,"r2_120":0.9479,"slope_250":-77.1156,"r2_250":0.7889,"high52":29100.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":11.9759,"dd_52w":-88.0241,"mdd_1y":-86.3996,"atr14_pct":10.8014,"vol_ann_60":106.1435,"vol_avg20":1055.6,"vol_ratio20":0.3799,"vr5":0.872,"vr20":0.6203,"amount_avg5":6774281.0,"amount_avg20":4430159.0,"amount_avg60":10129234.3333,"obv_chg20":-61.5337,"turnover_20":10.2632,"pv_eff_20":-3.4437,"rsi14":31.4778,"frgn_net_5":138.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0671,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0671,"frgn_net_20":154.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0749,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0749,"frgn_net_60":159.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0773,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0773,"frgn_net_120":808.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.3928,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.3928,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-36.0,"op_margin_q":-2.4641,"op_qoq":58.6207,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-2.8571,"rev_yoy":-10.7514,"op_trend_4q":5.617,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.65,"debt_ratio":95.33,"per":35.56,"pbr":0.46,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"